Especially when hope is the last thing you have. ;)

And there’s something beautiful about that: hope doesn’t require certainty.

Faith can give hope a foundation. Knowledge can give it direction. Love can give it purpose. And action can give it a chance to become reality.

Even at rock bottom, you can still look up.

Hope is the possibility that the story isn’t finished yet.

And sometimes, you’re the one who gets to write the next chapter. 🤛